# A Three-Stage Evaluation of a Distance Education Course.

**Authors:** Stanford, J. D., Imrie, B. W.

## Abstract
Reports the results of a three-stage evaluation of &quot;Monetary Economics,&quot; an undergraduate credit course offered to external or distance students of the University of Queensland in 1979 and 1980. Twenty-eight references are listed. (Author/LLS)

